OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,FBev Craig has been elected as the new
OL,7,FMayor of Greater Manchester.
OL,9,FMs Craig, who has long been tipped as
OL,10,FLabour's candidate for the mayoralty,
OL,11,Fpreviously served as deputy mayor in
OL,12,FGreater Manchester with a portfolio
OL,13,Fcovering the economy, business and
OL,14,F"inclusive growth".
OL,16,FHer priorities include the cost-of-
OL,17,Fliving, reviving declining town
OL,18,Fcentres, building affordable homes and
OL,19,Freducing bus fares.
OL,26,@vD@AOUvD@RO]
