OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,FShe has been the leader of Manchester
OL,7,FCity Council since December 2021,
OL,8,Fsucceeding the long-serving Sir
OL,9,FRichard Leese in the post.
OL,11,FWhat is her backstory?
OL,13,FThe 41-year-old is the first ever
OL,14,Ffemale Mayor of Greater Manchester and
OL,15,Fwas the first LGBT leader of the city
OL,16,Fcouncil.
OL,18,FOriginally from Northern Ireland,
OL,19,FCraig moved to Greater Manchester aged
OL,20,F18.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
