CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785540774
OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,FShe has previously said: "Greater
OL,7,FManchester is a special place - from
OL,8,Fthe industrial revolution, the trade
OL,9,Funion and cooperative movements and
OL,10,Fthe suffragettes - this place has
OL,11,Falways fought for progress.
OL,13,F"This place changed my life and I owe
OL,14,Fit everything, it gave me
OL,15,Fopportunities I could never have
OL,16,Fimagined, and I've spent my career
OL,17,Ftrying to give something back.
OL,26,@nD@ZOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
