CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785540774
OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,F"While Westminster left places like
OL,7,Fours behind, Greater Manchester has
OL,8,Ftaken control of our own future and
OL,9,Fwe've started building our own success.
OL,11,FBev Craig stood in the by-election on
OL,12,FThursday 30 July 2026 against six
OL,13,Fother candidates.
OL,15,FThe voter turnout was the lowest in
OL,16,Fthe history of the Greater Manchester
OL,17,Fmayoralty, at just 25.14%.
OL,19,FWhat does she want to deliver for
OL,20,FGreater Manchester?
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
