SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785540774
OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,FBev Craig said that as a mayor she
OL,7,Fwill "apply a simple test: will it
OL,8,Fmake life better?"
OL,10,FLabour pointed to her experience as
OL,11,Fdeputy mayor as it announced her as
OL,12,Fits candidate, referring to work she
OL,13,Fhad done to attract international
OL,14,Fbusinesses to the city region, as well
OL,15,Fas her work overseeing the
OL,16,Fconstruction of affordable housing as
OL,17,Fleader of Manchester City Council.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
