CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785540774
OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,FShe said: "I will work every day for
OL,7,Fus to make sure everyone shares in the
OL,8,Fsuccess Greater Manchester is building
OL,9,F` making sure there's more money in
OL,10,Fpeople's pockets, pride in every town
OL,11,Fcentre with a New High Streets Fund, a
OL,12,Fnew generation of council and
OL,13,Faffordable homes and an expanded Bee
OL,14,FNetwork that freezes fares and that
OL,15,Fworks for all of us."
OL,17,FWhy did the mayoral by-election
OL,18,Fhappen, and what is her link to Prime
OL,19,FMinister Andy Burnham?
OL,26,@nD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
