OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,FThe Greater Manchester Mayoral
OL,7,FElection was triggered after her
OL,8,Ffriend, Prime Minister Andy Burnham,
OL,9,Fbecame the MP for the Makerfield
OL,10,Fconstituency in Wigan.
OL,12,FOn Mr Burnham, she has previously
OL,13,Fsaid: "Working alongside former mayor
OL,14,FAndy Burnham, we have achieved so much
OL,15,Fover the (years) ` bringing buses back
OL,16,Funder public control, creating jobs,
OL,17,Fattracting investment, and pushing
OL,18,FGreater Manchester forward as a real
OL,19,Fpowerhouse of the North West."
OL,26,@uD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
