OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,FBurnham himself supported her
OL,7,Fcampaign, saying he has "no doubt that
OL,8,Fshe will work every single day to
OL,9,Fbuild on the progress we've all made
OL,10,Ftogether".
OL,12,FBefore the election, he added: "Bev
OL,13,Fwill focus on putting more money in
OL,14,Fyour pocket, giving families more
OL,15,Fbreathing space on the cost of living,
OL,16,Fand making sure young people across
OL,17,Fevery borough have the opportunities
OL,18,Fthey need to thrive.
OL,26,@tD@`OU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
