PN,36109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785540774
OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,F"Bev will do this by working in
OL,7,Flockstep with every community across
OL,8,Four city region so we can shape our
OL,9,Ffuture together.
OL,11,F"She is the only candidate who will
OL,12,Fmake sure every town, every borough
OL,13,Fand every person shares in Greater
OL,14,FManchester's success."
OL,16,FFellow metro mayor Steve Rotheram, who
OL,17,Fis the Mayor of the Liverpool City
OL,18,FRegion, said Bev Craig is "first
OL,19,Fclass".
OL,26,@sD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
