OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,FRotheram is good friends with Prime
OL,7,FMinister Andy Burnham and they worked
OL,8,Fclosely during Burnham's time as Mayor
OL,9,Fof Greater Manchester.
OL,11,FHe said: "She is absolutely first
OL,12,Fclass and I know she will continue the
OL,13,Fwork that Andy has done and build on
OL,14,Fthat, and shape things in her own way
OL,15,Fto really reflect what Manchester's
OL,16,Fopportunities (are), and the growth
OL,17,Fthat can happen there. I think its a
OL,18,Fgreat thing for everyone."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/11
