OL,3,CWho is Bev Craig, Greater Manchester's
OL,4,Cnew mayor?
OL,6,FShe will hold office until the next
OL,7,Fscheduled election for the mayoralty
OL,8,Fin May 2028.
OL,10,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,11,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,12,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,13,Four region.
